OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early showers across
OL,6,Fnorthern coasts will soon clear,
OL,7,Fleaving a bright day with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Sunshine will turn a
OL,9,Flittle hazy at times through the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Mainly light winds, a
OL,11,Fmoderate northwesterly at first over
OL,12,FBuchan.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA dry evening with some
OL,15,Fsunshine to end the day. Remaining dry
OL,16,Fovernight and with clear skies and
OL,17,Flight winds, becoming chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
