OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and some hazy
OL,7,Fsunny spells. However the cloud may be
OL,8,Fthick enough for the odd spot of rain
OL,9,Fin the morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fvery warm period with a good deal of
OL,13,Fdry and bright weather. There will
OL,14,Falso be the chance of some showery
OL,15,Fbursts of rain which could be heavy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
